  <div class="row">
    <div class="row__l"><span class="kicker">L2</span><span class="row__n">The kit</span><a class="row__go" href="/getting-started/quickstart/">quickstart →</a></div>
    <p class="row__p">One orchestrator. Accounts by chain id, one account interface for every module.</p>
    <div class="row__d">
      <div class="defs">
        <div><b>Keyring</b><span> — Many accounts from one seed. Imports: seed, private key, Tonkeeper words.</span></div>
        <div><b>Policies</b><span> — Fee caps, allow-lists, block-lists, a confirm hook. Run before every signature.</span></div>
        <div><b>History</b><span> — Every send, swap and Earn op; each module labels its own transactions.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
